<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    DnnMigration.Domain - the innermost layer of the Clean/Onion Architecture backend.

    A pure-POCO class library (entities, enums and repository interfaces) that has
    ZERO dependencies by design: it pulls in no NuGet packages and points at no other
    project. Every other backend project depends on this one; this one depends on
    nothing, so it compiles first (Domain -> Application -> Infrastructure -> Api).

    The file is intentionally minimal. All shared build configuration is centralized
    in backend/Directory.Build.props, which MSBuild applies automatically by walking
    up the directory tree. That props file is the single source of truth, so its
    settings are deliberately not repeated in this project file.

    The assembly name and base namespace default from the file name 'DnnMigration.Domain'
    (matching DnnMigration.Domain.Entities / .Enums / .Interfaces), and the SDK
    automatically includes every C# source file beneath this folder, so no explicit
    item groups or property overrides are required here.
  -->

</Project>
